 "licences": {
  "HWSB_PASS": "In w* (12 x 12 cylinder, p 0.2, sigma 1.75), two transformers trained by the E4 recipe (masters 620201, 620202, step 5000) each reached captured >= 0.8 on 4,096 fresh pilot histories. In each, the K4b LCC chart rule built a circle that passed C0-cal on 512 fresh landmarks and C0-val on 512 fresh validation rows. On 3,072 fresh validation rows each pilot capture ratio reached the frozen c_min (80 % planned stage-C power at margin 0.01 with N_C rows, alpha = 0.05/3). Stage C may be planned with N_C = {N_C}, 3 models and a training forecast of {training_forecast_s} CPU-s; Z_bound(w*) = {Z_bound}. It does not license: that any circle carries beyond-four information (pilot statistics are uncertified, multiplicity-uncontrolled and on pilot models); that stage C will reach SUPPORT; that new stage-C models will pass their gates; anything about the E4 models, K4b's EXCLUSION or any earlier verdict; that w* is optimal.",
  "HWSB_NOT_LEARNED": "With the E4 recipe unchanged, {k} of 2 pilot models did not reach captured 0.8 in w*. It does not license: that w* is unlearnable, or that a longer or larger recipe would fail; any statement about the circle.",
  "HWSB_NO_CIRCLE": "Both pilot models learned the prediction task, but in model(s) {models} the K4b LCC chart rule did not yield a chart passing C0-cal/C0-val (criterion {criterion}) on fresh pilot histories. It does not license: that no circular structure exists (another chart method might find it); anything about E4.",
  "HWSB_UNDERPOWERED": "The pilot models learned and charted, but the pilot capture or its row variance implies that a stage C at margin 0.01 within the K4b ladder (<= 12,288 rows) would not have 80 % planned power. It does not license: absence of the effect; an effect below the margin as a finding.",
  "POSITIVE_BELOW_PLANNING": "Annotation POSITIVE_BELOW_PLANNING: the pilot circles covary positively with r4 on pilot histories (bootstrap lower bound > 0), below what stage C could detect at the margin.",
  "INCONCLUSIVE/RESOURCE_OR_AUTHORITY": "No scientific statement is licensed.",
  "FAIL_TECHNICAL": "No scientific statement is licensed.",
  "fallback_rule": "No outcome licenses the next world (W12-q1-s2.0-p0.2, then W12-q1-s1.25-p0.8333), a recipe change, extra seeds or a larger pilot automatically; after any outcome other than HWSB_PASS the coordinator reports in plain language and the owner decides (Q4)."
